# Walkthrough: AI Plan Timetable Fix & Upgrade

I have fixed the "AI Plan" timetable feature and upgraded it with true AI (LLM) capabilities.

## Changes Made

### 1. Robust Heuristic Planner
- **Broadened Search**: The planner now checks multiple time slots (9 AM, 11 AM, 2 PM, 4 PM, 7 PM) across the next 7 days instead of just 10 AM and 2 PM.
- **Timezone Awareness**: Fixed a bug where aware Singapore time was being compared wrongly with naive UTC strings in the database.
- **Improved Logic**: The algorithm now properly handles assignment due dates and avoids overlapping with existing classes or previously suggested study blocks.

### 2. AI Tool Integration
- **Direct Scheduling**: Added [create_timetable_event](file:///Users/oli/Desktop/CraftCanvas/backend/services/ai_tools.py#342-367) and [delete_timetable_event](file:///Users/oli/Desktop/CraftCanvas/backend/services/ai_tools.py#368-380) tools to the Gemini AI layer.
- **Conversational Planning**: You can now ask the AI Chat things like:
  - *"Schedule 2 hours of study for CS2103T tomorrow"*
  - *"Delete the study block on Wednesday"*

### 3. Frontend Feedback
- **Informative Notifications**: Updated the "AI Plan" button to show a helpful toast if no assignments are found or if no free slots are available, rather than failing silently.

## Verification Results

### Algorithm Test
I ran a simulation of the new planning algorithm which confirmed:
- It correctly identifies free gaps in the schedule.
- It respects assignment deadlines.
- It handles timezone conversions between SGT and UTC naive correctly.

### AI Tool Verification
Tools are registered and ready for use via the Command Center (Gemini).
